      "featured_image": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0631/0251/7500/files/4_3_pantalica_01.jpg?v=1754386050",
      "description_html": "<section class=\"content-block dimension-medium\" id=\"block-0\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content\">\n<div class=\"block-text block-text__align-left  row animation-y\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<p class=\"generic-text  padding-line-element\">Balancing sinuous curves with elegant linearity, the Pantalica daybed by Elisa Ossino brings a sculptural form to outdoor lounge areas. Rooted in rustic Mediterranean inspiration, the Pantalica collection is named after the famous UNESCO World Heritage Site in southeastern Sicily.</p>\n<section class=\"content-block dimension-medium\" id=\"block-1\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content\">\n<div class=\"block-text block-text__align-left  row animation-y\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"generic-text\">This chaise longue design is influenced by archaic forms, harkening back to the ancient cultures of Sicily and the Mediterranean basin. The daybed is crafted from materials that can be reintroduced to the production cycle at the end of life, making this distinctive piece a circular design.</p>\n<section class=\"content-block\" id=\"block-2\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content  dimension-medium\">\n<div class=\"block-text-img block-text-img_small block-text-img_text-right  row\">\n<div class=\"block-text-img-text  col-4  is-768\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"generic-text\">Built upon a sturdy aluminum base, the Pantalica daybed is carefully woven with weatherproof polypropylene rattan, infusing the piece with a natural look and feel that is preserved across time.</p>\n<p class=\"block-text-label\"><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><span>A cylindrical motif defines the cushions for a visually compelling effect that is also highly ergonomic, enhancing the comfort of the daybed. Held in place by an EVA strap, the headrest is the ideal shape for supporting the neck, while the liner cushion molds to the contours of the body.</span><br></p>\n<p class=\"block-text-label\"><span><meta charset=\"utf-8\">Fully removable, the cushion covers are available in any fabric from the Molteni&amp;C Outdoor Collection.<br></span></p>\n<section class=\"content-block dimension-medium\" id=\"block-4\">\n<div class=\"wrapper-content\">\n<div class=\"block-text block-text__align-left  row animation-y\">\n<div class=\"col-12\">\n<div>\n<p class=\"generic-text\">The Pantalica daybed can be complemented by the Pantalica coffee table, Pantalica stools, Pantalica rug, and all other designs from the Molteni&amp;C Outdoor Collection for a harmonious composition.<br></p>\n<p class=\"block-text-label\"> </p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<div class=\"show-for-mobile  padding-line-element\"><br></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>"
